{"seq":2,"slug":"ring-buffer","title":"环形缓冲：把无限历史钉成常数内存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/recording/ring-buffer","wordCount":1526,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"环形缓冲-把无限历史钉成常数内存\">环形缓冲：把无限历史钉成常数内存</h1><p>倒流的历史是持续增长的：玩了十分钟就有十分钟的过去。如果照直用一个不断 append 的数组，内存会随游玩时间线性膨胀，几十分钟后必然爆掉。可玩家其实只需要最近的一段——赛车回退三秒、《Braid》回退整关但也有上限。既然只需要一个「最近 N 帧」的滑动窗口，就该用一个固定容量、写满即覆盖的数据结构。环形缓冲（ring buffer / circular buffer）正是干这个的，它是几乎所有倒流实现的存储底座。上一篇 <a href=\"state-snapshots\">状态快照</a> 造好了每帧的 <code>Frame</code>，这一篇讲把这些 <code>Frame</code> 放进哪里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>环形缓冲是倒流历史的存储底座：用固定容量把「无限增长的过去」钉成常数内存。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>固定数组 + 绕回写指针</strong>：逻辑上是一个圈，新数据覆盖最旧数据，容量恒定。</li>\n<li><strong>O(1) 写入</strong>：写指针每帧前进一格并对容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 取模，写满后直接覆盖，无分配、无搬移。</li>\n<li><strong>容量换算</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = f \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = f \\cdot T \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>——三个旋钮决定能倒多久、吃多少内存。</li>\n<li><strong>边界策略</strong>：写满后是滚动覆盖、倒流中冻结，还是满则停录。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>它把「倒流历史」从一条不断变长的线，变成一个固定大小的滑动窗口，这是几乎所有倒流实现的共同起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"环形缓冲的核心\">环形缓冲的核心</h2><p>环形缓冲是一段固定长度的数组，配一个不断前进、到头就绕回开头的写指针。逻辑上它是一个圈：新数据覆盖最旧的数据，容量恒定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[新一帧 Frame] --&gt; B[写入 buffer at write_idx]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;write_idx = (write_idx + 1) % N&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D{已写满 N 帧?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[有效帧数 count 递增]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[最旧帧被自动覆盖&lt;br/&gt;read 起点前移]&#10;    E --&gt; G[窗口 = 最近 count 帧]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[新一帧 Frame] --&gt; B[写入 buffer at write_idx]\n    B --&gt; C[\"write_idx = (write_idx + 1) % N\"]\n    C --&gt; D{已写满 N 帧?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[有效帧数 count 递增]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[最旧帧被自动覆盖&lt;br/&gt;read 起点前移]\n    E --&gt; G[窗口 = 最近 count 帧]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>写指针 <code>write_idx</code> 每帧前进一格并对容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 取模，因此永远落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内。当缓冲写满后，新帧直接覆盖当前 <code>write_idx</code> 指向的最旧帧——没有任何分配、没有任何搬移，写入是严格的 O(1)。这就是它内存恒定、性能稳定的根源：无论玩多久，占用都锁死在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 帧。SitronX 的开源 UnityTimeRewinder、多数 Unreal 倒流插件底层都是这一结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容量与可倒流时长的换算\">容量与可倒流时长的换算</h2><p>环形缓冲的容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 直接决定「能倒多久」和「吃多少内存」，这是设计倒流系统时第一个要算清的数。</p>\n<p>设每帧快照平均字节数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，采样帧率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>（每秒采样次数），目标可倒流时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，则所需容量与内存为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\lceil f \\cdot T \\rceil, \\qquad M = N \\cdot S = f \\cdot T \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：想要 10 秒倒流、每秒采样 30 次、每帧快照 4KB，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> 帧、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>KB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mtext>MB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = 300 \\times 4\\text{KB} = 1.2\\text{MB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这三个旋钮里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是设计需求，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 由 <a href=\"state-snapshots\">状态快照</a> 的捕获范围决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 由 <a href=\"sampling-rate\">采样率与插值</a> 决定——想省内存，压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（见 <a href=\"../practice/rewind-memory\">内存与压缩</a>）或降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，而不是牺牲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标时长 T</th>\n<th>采样率 f</th>\n<th>单帧 S</th>\n<th>容量 N</th>\n<th>内存 M</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3 秒（赛车回退）</td>\n<td>30/s</td>\n<td>2KB</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>180KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 秒（通用倒流）</td>\n<td>30/s</td>\n<td>4KB</td>\n<td>300</td>\n<td>1.2MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60 秒（长倒流）</td>\n<td>15/s</td>\n<td>4KB</td>\n<td>900</td>\n<td>3.6MB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整关（Braid 级）</td>\n<td>10/s</td>\n<td>压缩后 ~0.7KB</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>目标 40MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多速率环-让远处历史变稀疏\">多速率环：让远处历史变稀疏</h2><p>玩家对「刚刚」的记忆需要高精度（否则倒放不平滑），但对「一分钟前」的精度要求低得多——那么远的历史通常只用于快速跳回，几帧误差无所谓。据此可以做多速率环（multi-rate buffer）：近处密、远处疏。</p>\n<p>搜索到的一种实现是级联多个环：第一个环存 1x 速率（每帧）的近期数据，第二个环每隔一帧才写（等效 2x 时间跨度），第三个每四帧写一次，以此类推。越靠后的环速率越低，却能覆盖越长的时间。总内存受控，而近处依然精细。</p>\n<p>这与图形学的 mipmap、下面几篇会提到的多分辨率压缩是同一种「按距离降精度」的思想。多速率环的代价是回放逻辑更复杂：跨环边界时要处理不同采样密度间的衔接。除非确实需要超长倒流，通常单速率环 + 压缩已经够用；多速率是 <a href=\"../practice/rewind-memory\">内存与压缩</a> 里的进阶手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"写满之后-三种边界策略\">写满之后：三种边界策略</h2><p>当环形缓冲写满、玩家又在持续游玩，最旧的历史被覆盖是必然的。但「谁被覆盖、什么时候停止记录」有三种策略，对应不同玩法。</p>\n<p>第一种是<strong>滚动覆盖</strong>（默认）：永远保留最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 帧，最旧的自动丢弃。适合视觉倒放型——玩家反正只倒最近几秒。第二种是<strong>倒流中冻结</strong>：玩家正在倒流回放时暂停记录，避免一边读一边被写覆盖导致读到脏帧。第三种是<strong>满则停录</strong>：到达上限后停止记录（不再覆盖），适合「倒流是有限资源」的设计，比如能量条耗尽就不能再倒。</p>\n<p>选错策略会出现经典 bug：倒流回放时若不冻结写入，读指针可能撞上仍在前进的写指针，读到刚被覆盖的半新半旧数据，画面出现撕裂式跳变。所以回放期间对写入的处理，必须和回放系统协同设计，详见 <a href=\"../playback/reverse-playback\">倒放与插值</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>倒流历史是滑动窗口，用固定容量、写满即覆盖的环形缓冲把内存钉成常数，写入 O(1)。</li>\n<li>容量换算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = f \\cdot T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = f \\cdot T \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>；省内存靠压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 或降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，别牺牲时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>多速率环让远处历史变稀疏，用可控内存换超长倒流，代价是回放跨环衔接更复杂。</li>\n<li>写满后有滚动覆盖、倒流中冻结、满则停录三种策略；回放期间不冻结写入会读到脏帧、画面撕裂。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>单帧快照 S 从哪来：<a href=\"state-snapshots\">状态快照</a></li>\n<li>采样率 f 怎么选：<a href=\"sampling-rate\">采样率与插值</a></li>\n<li>跨库：内存作为帧预算的一部分，见 <a href=\"../../game-performance-optimization/foundations/frame-budget\">游戏性能优化 · 帧预算</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"环形缓冲：把无限历史钉成常数内存","id":"环形缓冲-把无限历史钉成常数内存"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"环形缓冲的核心","id":"环形缓冲的核心"},{"level":2,"text":"容量与可倒流时长的换算","id":"容量与可倒流时长的换算"},{"level":2,"text":"多速率环：让远处历史变稀疏","id":"多速率环-让远处历史变稀疏"},{"level":2,"text":"写满之后：三种边界策略","id":"写满之后-三种边界策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"状态快照：捕获什么、怎么打包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/recording/state-snapshots"},"next":{"title":"采样率与插值：记多密，以及漏不得的离散事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/recording/sampling-rate"}}